Third-party material
--------------------
src/pdf/data/*.json — derived from Mozilla pdf.js (src/core/metrics.js, encodings.js, glyphlist.js),
  Copyright 2012 Mozilla Foundation, Apache License 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
  Generated by scripts/gen-font-data.mjs.
@embedpdf/pdfium — PDFium compiled to WebAssembly (MIT wrapper; PDFium itself Apache-2.0 / BSD-3-Clause).
harfbuzzjs / HarfBuzz — font subsetting (MIT).
fflate — zlib in JavaScript (MIT).
React, Zustand, i18next, Vite — MIT.
@fontsource/ibm-plex-sans, /gaegu, /caveat — UI fonts (SIL OFL 1.1).

Fallback fonts (downloaded by scripts/fetch-fonts.mjs into public/fonts, license files stored alongside)
  Arimo, Tinos, Cousine (Apache-2.0 / OFL), Carlito, Caladea (OFL), Gelasio (OFL),
  Noto Sans / Noto Serif (OFL), Nanum Gothic / Nanum Myeongjo (OFL).
These are embedded (as subsets) into a PDF only when the original font lacks a character you type.
